{"text": "Tell me the way, said the Nightingale, for I am not afraid. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You must make the rose out of music by moonlight, said the tree. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> All night long you must sing with your breast against a thorn. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The thorn will pierce your heart, and your life will flow into my veins. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Death is a great price to pay for a red rose, cried the Nightingale, and Life is very dear to all. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Yet Love is better than Life, and what is the heart of a bird compared to the heart of a man. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She flew back to the Student and said, Be happy, for you shall have your red rose. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> All that I ask is that you will be a true lover. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Student looked up and listened, but he could not understand her, because he only knew the things that are written in books. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But the oak tree, who loved the little Nightingale, felt sad and asked her for one last song. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When she finished her song, the Student said, She sings beautifully, but she has no real feeling. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She would never give up anything for others, he thought.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "e", "l", "l", " ", "m", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "a", "y", ",", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "N", "i", "g", "h", "t", "i", "n", "g", "a", "l", "e", ",", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "I", " ", "a", "m", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "a", "f", "r", "a", "i", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "Y", "o", "u", " ", "m", "u", "s", "t", " ", "m", "a", "k", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "r", "o", "s", "e", " ", "o", "u", "t", " ", "o", "f", " ", "m", "u", "s", "i", "c", " ", "b", "y", " ", "m", "o", "o", "n", "l", "i", "g", "h", "t", ",", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "t", "r", "e", "e", ".", 